        "496": {"synopsis":"Calls the word of the CALL_TABLE entry at IX (at IX+1), HL and AF as given: this ROM's table\nwhen port $E3 selects bank 0, otherwise the table at $2000 + IX's low byte in the paged\nbank. Called from $19EB, $1A12, $1B9A, $1BA4, $1BB2, $1C76 and $1DDC.\nChanges: IX (to $20xx for a bank other than 0).","comment":"AF kept"},
        "497": {"comment":"Bank of $2000-$3FFF"},
        "499": {"comment":"Bank bits"},
        "501": {"comment":"Bank 0: this ROM's table"},
        "503": {"comment":"Else the bank's table"},
