        "724": {"synopsis":"IDE_DOS_MAP's work: MAP_UNIT_VEC for unit D (bit 7 ignored); on success the unit's table\nbyte ($2006) is stored at HL.\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"HL kept"},
