        "738": {"synopsis":"IDE_DOS_UNMAP's work: UNMAP_DRIVE_VEC for drive A; on success the drive's table byte ($2310\n+ A) = $FF.\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"Drive kept"},
