        "1272": {"synopsis":"CALL $04F8 + a byte: the 32-bit field at IX + the byte = BC (low word) and DE (high word).\nHL kept; A = the byte.","comment":"HL = the byte's address"},
        "1273": {"comment":"A = the offset"},
        "1275": {"comment":"Return address past it"},
        "1276": {"comment":"Base IX"},
        "1278": {"comment":"On"},
        "1280": {"synopsis":"CALL $0500 + a byte: as STORE_IX for IY.","comment":"HL = the byte's address"},
        "1281": {"comment":"A = the offset"},
        "1283": {"comment":"Return address past it"},
        "1284": {"comment":"Base IY"},
        "1286": {"comment":"HL = the base, HL kept","synopsis":"Stores BC (low word) and DE (high word) at HL + A, HL kept."},
        "1287": {"comment":"Plus the offset"},
        "1289": {"comment":"BC: the low word"},
        "1293": {"comment":"DE: the high word"},
        "1296": {"comment":"HL back"},
        "1298": {"synopsis":"RST $08's work, the API call whose code is the byte after the RST:\n1. IX = the caller's HL (the caller's IX kept on the stack), the caller's AF' kept, the\n   interrupt state read (LD A,I), the return address moved past the byte, L = the code.\n2. Interrupts off; port $E3 = $80 (CONMEM, bank 0); SP kept at $2014. A caller's SP below\n   $4000 gives a stack at $2100 (interrupts left off); otherwise interrupts on again if they\n   were.\n3. NextReg $8E = 3 (ROM 3); GO_3CFD_BANK0; then $33B4 in DivMMC RAM with A = the code, HL =\n   the caller's HL.\n4. SP back from $2014 (after $1FF3, the fetch at $1FF8 ending the automap); port $E3 = $82\n   (CONMEM, bank 2); interrupts on if they were.\n5. IX back; AF = the AF' the routine left, and the caller's AF' back.\nExit: AF as the routine left it in AF'; BC, DE, HL as it left them.","comment":"HL = the code's address"},
        "1299": {"comment":"IX = the caller's HL, IX kept"},
        "1301": {"comment":"AF' to AF"},
        "1302": {"comment":"Caller's AF' kept"},
        "1303": {"comment":"P/V = interrupts were on"},
        "1305": {"comment":"A = the code"},
        "1306": {"comment":"Return address past it"},
        "1308": {"comment":"L = the code"},
        "1309": {"comment":"Interrupts off"},
        "1310": {"comment":"CONMEM, bank 0"},
        "1314": {"comment":"Caller's SP kept"},
        "1318": {"comment":"Its high byte"},
        "1321": {"comment":"$8000 or above?"},
        "1322": {"comment":"Yes: keep it"},
        "1324": {"comment":"$4000 or above?"},
        "1325": {"comment":"Yes: keep it"},
        "1327": {"comment":"Below $4000: stack at $2100"},
        "1330": {"comment":"Interrupts stay off"},
        "1332": {"comment":"Interrupts were off?","synopsis":"RST08_DISPATCH: interrupts on again if they were on."},
        "1335": {"comment":"No: on again"},
        "1336": {"comment":"Interrupt state kept","synopsis":"RST08_DISPATCH's step 3: ROM 3, GO_3CFD_BANK0, the call at $33B4."},
        "1337": {"comment":"ROM 3"},
