        "1377": {"synopsis":"Not reached from this ROM: AF kept, then as from $0562 (AF back at its end).","comment":"AF kept"},
        "1378": {"synopsis":"The automap point $0562 (NextReg $BB bit 3, ROM 3 paged in, delayed; zxnext.vhd):\nGO_3CFD_BANK0 ($3CFD in DivMMC RAM, port $E3 = $80), then port $E3 = $0A (bank 10, CONMEM\noff), AF from the stack, RET.","comment":"Bank 0 code at $3CFD"},
        "1381": {"comment":"Bank 10, CONMEM off"},
        "1385": {"comment":"AF from the stack"},
        "1386": {"comment":"Return"},
        "1387": {"synopsis":"Not reached from this ROM: on to $3886 in DivMMC RAM.","comment":"On in DivMMC RAM"},
        "1390": {"synopsis":"A buffer for sector A of cluster DEBC on volume IX, without reading the sector:\nCLUSTER_SECTOR, then BUF_ASSIGN. Called from CLUSTER_CLEAR.\nExit: carry set, HL = the buffer, BCDE = the sector; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"BCDE = the sector"},
        "1393": {"comment":"Failed"},
        "1394": {"comment":"A buffer for it"},
        "1397": {"comment":"Success"},
        "1399": {"synopsis":"Moves a position on by one sector: the count at IY + BC (sectors done in the current\ncluster) goes up by one; when it reaches the sectors per cluster (IX+$21), the cluster in\nthe four bytes after the count becomes the next one in its chain (FAT_READ) and the count 0.\nCalled from $1138, $1425 and $1472.\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear, A = the code (rc_eof, $19, when the chain has\nended).","comment":"HL = IY + BC"},
        "1403": {"comment":"One more sector"},
        "1404": {"comment":"A = the count"},
        "1405": {"comment":"HL at the cluster"},
