        "1594": {"comment":"Then $0EAC"},
        "1597": {"comment":"Done"},
        "1598": {"synopsis":"Adds a cluster after cluster DEBC on volume IX: CLUSTER_ALLOC, then the FAT entry of DEBC =\nthe new cluster (FAT_WRITE). Called from $11DA and $14CF. IY kept.\nExit: carry set, DEBC = the new cluster; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"IY kept"},
        "1600": {"comment":"The old cluster kept"},
        "1602": {"comment":"A new one"},
        "1605": {"comment":"HL = its low word"},
