        "1623": {"synopsis":"Frees the chain from cluster DEBC on volume IX, not called from this ROM: each cluster's FAT\nentry is read for the next and set to 0 (FAT_WRITE), and the free count (IX+$2B) goes up by\none ($1FD2), until a number that is not a cluster of the volume; then $0EAC and\nFLUSH_BUFFERS.\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear on failure.","comment":"IY kept"},
