        "1672": {"synopsis":"Fills cluster DEBC of volume IX with zeros: a buffer for its first sector (CLUSTER_BUF_NEW)\nis cleared and written to each of its sectors in turn ($1EC4). Called from $11DD.\nExit: carry set on success; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"Cluster kept"},
