        "1731": {"synopsis":"BCDE = the number of sector A of cluster DEBC on volume IX: the cluster x the sectors per\ncluster (IX+$21) + A + the 32-bit value at IX+$26. IY kept.\nExit: carry set, BCDE = the sector (DE its low word); carry clear, A = 2 (rc_seek) when A is\nnot below the sectors per cluster.","comment":"Inside a cluster?"},
