        "1774": {"synopsis":"A buffer holding sector A of cluster DEBC on volume IX: CLUSTER_SECTOR, then BUF_READ.\nCalled from $1168 and $1CE4.\nExit: carry set, HL = the buffer; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"BCDE = the sector"},
        "1777": {"comment":"Failed"},
