        "1781": {"synopsis":"Not reached from this ROM: BC = the word at HL (HL past it), COPY_TO_BANK2, DE down and BC\nup by one, HL = $00F3, then on into COPY_TO_BANK2.","comment":"BC = the word at HL"},
