        "2322": {"synopsis":"DEBC = the FAT entry of cluster DEBC on volume IX (the next cluster in its chain):\n1. Not a cluster of the volume: rc_seek (2).\n2. The entry's offset (the cluster x 2, or x 4 when bit 7 of IX+$13 is clear) gives its\n   sector, counted from IX+$19-$1A, and its place in the sector.\n3. The sector's buffer (BUF_READ); the entry read: 16 bits, or 32 bits with the top 4\n   cleared.\nExit: carry set, DEBC = the entry; carry clear, A = the code.","comment":"A cluster of the volume?"},
