        "3222": {"comment":"Success"},
        "3224": {"synopsis":"Counts the free clusters of the volume at IX by reading every sector of the first FAT: a\nFAT16 entry (two bytes) or FAT32 entry (four, the top 4 bits ignored) of 0 counts one\n($1FD2 adds one to IX+$2B). Called from $09D2 when the free count is not known; ends in\nFREE_COUNT_GET.\nExit: carry set and BCDE = the free count (also at IX+$2B); carry clear and A = the error.\nChanges: IY.","comment":"The count 0"},
        "3230": {"comment":"The free count at IX+$2B"},
