        "4741": {"comment":"A volume label?"},
        "4747": {"comment":"All the parts there?"},
        "4750": {"comment":"The count cleared"},
        "4754": {"comment":"No: no long name"},
        "4756": {"comment":"The checksum"},
        "4759": {"comment":"Its parts'?"},
        "4762": {"comment":"No: no long name"},
        "4764": {"comment":"$FF: a long name"},
        "4768": {"synopsis":"Directory-record calls (the vector at $0127) chosen by B, on the working record $2E50\n(WORK_DIR_SELECT):\n1. B = 1: drive A's record copied to $2E50 ($0A1A), at its first entry; HL = $2E50,\nA = 15. From $02F4, setting the default drive.\n2. B = 2: $2E50 copied back to drive A's record ($0A0A).\n3. B = 3: $2E50 to the root (DIR_REC_ROOT).\n4. B = 4: $2E50 copied to $2E5F.\n5. B = 5: into the directory at $2E50's entry (DIR_ENTER_SUB).\n6. Another B: A = $3A (rc_notimp) through $0014.\nExit: carry set; or carry clear and A = the error.","comment":"The working record"},
        "4771": {"comment":"B = 1?"},
        "4773": {"comment":"Drive A's record to it"},
        "4776": {"comment":"At its first entry"},
        "4779": {"comment":"HL = it"},
        "4782": {"comment":"Its length"},
        "4785": {"synopsis":"B = 2: the working record copied to drive A's.","comment":"B = 2?"},
        "4787": {"comment":"IY = drive A's record"},
        "4790": {"comment":"DE = it"},
        "4793": {"comment":"From the working record"},
        "4803": {"synopsis":"B = 3: the root; B = 4: a copy at $2E5F.","comment":"B = 3?"},
        "4804": {"comment":"The working record to the root"},
        "4807": {"comment":"B = 4?"},
        "4809": {"comment":"The working record"},
        "4812": {"comment":"Copied to $2E5F"},
        "4822": {"synopsis":"B = 5: into the directory at the entry; others rc_notimp.","comment":"B = 5?"},
        "4823": {"comment":"Into the directory"},
        "4826": {"comment":"Not implemented"},
        "4829": {"synopsis":"Puts the first cluster of record IY's directory (0 for the root, DIR_AT_ROOT) into the\nsecond 32-byte entry from HL, the '..' of a new directory: its low word at +$3A, the high\nword at +$34.\nEntry: HL = the new directory's first entry.\nExit: IX kept.","comment":"The entries"},
        "4830": {"comment":"The root?"},
        "4833": {"comment":"IX = the entries"},
        "4835": {"comment":"Cluster 0"},
        "4841": {"comment":"The root: 0"},
