        "5399": {"synopsis":"DOS_BYTE_READ (the vector at $0148): the byte at handle A's pointer, the pointer moved on.\nExit: carry set, C = the byte, Z set when it is $1A (soft end of file); or carry clear and\nA = the error: $1D (rc_number) when the handle is not open for reading, $19 (rc_eof) at the\nend.","comment":"The handle"},
        "5402": {"comment":"Open for reading?"},
