        "5460": {"comment":"The pointer + 1"},
        "5463": {"comment":"Success"},
        "5465": {"synopsis":"Reads DE bytes from handle A's pointer to HL (the vector at $0142; ROM 2's READ_BLOCK).\n1. C without bit 7: 16K bank C is paged at $C000 (MMU 6 and 7, $0087) and bank 7 put back\nat the end ($0082).\n2. Not open for reading: $1D; at or past the end: $19. The count is cut to what is left of\nthe file ($200D); the bytes still wanted are at $200B, the destination at $2009.\n3. A sector at a time: a whole sector into a handle not open for writing goes straight\nfrom the card ($1EA5); otherwise it comes through the cache.\n4. Ending before all DE bytes were read gives $19.\nExit: carry set; or carry clear, A = the error and DE = the bytes not read.","comment":"The handle"},
        "5468": {"comment":"The destination"},
        "5471": {"comment":"The count"},
        "5475": {"comment":"The bank kept"},
        "5476": {"comment":"A bank to page?"},
        "5481": {"comment":"Open for reading?"},
        "5488": {"comment":"Inside the file?"},
