        "6987": {"synopsis":"Checks one path component at HL, up to '/', '\\' or $FF: characters $20-$7E, none of '\"' ':'\n'<' '>' '`' '|'.\nExit: Fc=1 valid, A = the end character, HL past it, IXL = $41 empty, $C1 a name, $81 a name\nwith '?' or '*'; Fc=0 an invalid character.","comment":"Empty so far"},
