        "7072": {"comment":"Vector $0127"},
        "7080": {"synopsis":"Walks path HL ($FF-ended) on drive A to its last component, without a path text.","comment":"No path text"},
        "7082": {"synopsis":"Walks path HL ($FF-ended) on drive A to its last component:\n1. The search record = the drive's current directory (vector $0127, B = 1); a leading '/' or\n   '\\' starts at the root.\n2. Each component before a separator is checked (PATH_PART_CHECK) and entered (DIR_ENTER).\n3. With B nonzero, the path text whose end BC points at follows: cut back to 'X:/' for a\n   root, a directory's name added or, for '..', taken off.\nExit: Fc=1, HL = the last component, DE = $2E50, A = $0F, the flags from IXL: S a last name\nis there, Z it has no wildcards; Fc=0 A = error ($14 rc_badname for a bad component).","comment":"Keep the text and the path"},
        "7084": {"comment":"B = 1: drive's current directory"},
