        "7205": {"synopsis":"Enters directory HL ($FF-ended) from the search record: '.' stays; any other name is looked\nup (DIR_NAME_FIND) and must be a directory, else error $45 (rc_notdir). With B nonzero the\npath text at BC (its end) gets the 8.3 name and '/' or, for '..', loses its last name. Then\nvector $0127 with B = 5 moves the search record into it.\nExit: Fc=1; Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"'.'?"},
        "7210": {"comment":"Then the end?"},
