        "7282": {"comment":"Vector $0127"},
        "7291": {"synopsis":"Looks up name HL (wildcards allowed) in the search record's directory from its start\n(DIR_FIND_NEXT, no filter), the entry read to $21C0.\nExit: Fc=1 found, A = attributes, Z when it is not a directory; Fc=0 not found or an error."},
        "7292": {"comment":"From the first entry"},
