        "7313": {"synopsis":"Vector $0139: the search record's next used entry (DIR_ENTRY_FIND, long name gathered) to\nthe buffer at DE: +0 attributes; +1 the 11-byte 8.3 name (bytes outside $20-$7E as '_'); +12\ntime, +14 date; +16 size; +20, with B bit 6, the 8 BASIC bytes of a +3DOS header ($FF and 7\nzeros without one); +28 the name text's length with its $FF; +30 the name text (long name,\nor NAME.EXT).\nExit: Fc=1, DE past the record; Fc=0 A = error ($17 rc_nofile at the end).","comment":"IY = $2E50, IX its volume"},
        "7316": {"comment":"Keep buffer and options"},
