        "7456": {"synopsis":"Vector $013C, on the search record $2E50: Fc=1 tells its entry number in DEHL; Fc=0 with Z\nsteps one entry on; Fc=0 with NZ moves to entry DEHL from the start. Telling: in a root\ndirectory of fixed size the sector index x 16 + the entry; otherwise the clusters before the\ncurrent one counted along the chain in bytes, plus the sector, / 32, + the entry in the\nsector.\nExit: Fc=1 (DEHL); Fc=0 A = error.","comment":"IY = $2E50, IX its volume"},
        "7459": {"comment":"Fc=0: move"},
        "7461": {"comment":"High word 0"},
        "7464": {"comment":"HL = sector or cluster field"},
        "7470": {"comment":"4 shifts: 16 entries a sector"},
        "7472": {"comment":"Root of fixed size?"},
        "7478": {"comment":"Byte count 0 (high, low)"},
        "7480": {"comment":"BCDE = first cluster"},
