        "7845": {"synopsis":"Reads sector BCDE of the device at IX (its record: +$01 first sector, +$07 size, +$10 flags)\nto HL, 512 bytes (SD_ADDRESS, SD_BLOCK_READ).\nExit: Fc=1, HL past the data; Fc=0 A = error (2 rc_seek: beyond the device; 0 rc_ready: the\ncard failed). BC, DE and IX kept."},
        "7846": {"synopsis":"Sector transfer for SD_SECTOR_READ (A = 0) and SD_SECTOR_WRITE (A = $80).","comment":"Keep BC, DE and the buffer"},
        "7849": {"comment":"HLDE = card address"},
        "7852": {"comment":"IX = buffer; device record kept"},
